From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Colin <colin@opd2413>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:15:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dp: avoid redundant retrain on stream enable and allow OOB HPD link retries

Two defects break DisplayPort link bring-up and recovery on USB-C OOB HPD
platforms (such as SM8750 with pmic_glink_altmode + drm_aux_hpd_bridge):

1. msm_dp_bridge_atomic_enable() sets force_link_train = true when
   !dp->power_on, immediately trains the link via msm_dp_ctrl_on_link()
   (leaving the sink in TPS2/3/4 until stream enable), and then calls
   msm_dp_display_enable(dp, force_link_train) -> msm_dp_ctrl_on_stream().
   msm_dp_ctrl_on_stream() therefore unconditionally calls
   msm_dp_ctrl_link_retrain() on top of the active training pattern
   without clearing it first and ignores the return value.  On USB-C
   DP-to-HDMI bridges (such as UGREEN HDMI 2.0 docks at 2-lane HBR3),
   this redundant retrain hits max v_level (-EAGAIN), leaving the sink
   untrained and the external monitor dark even though DP-1 reports
   enabled/On.  Since msm_dp_ctrl_on_link() has already trained the link
   immediately prior, pass force_link_train = false so
   msm_dp_ctrl_on_stream() only retrains if !msm_dp_ctrl_channel_eq_ok(),
   and clear the active training pattern before any fallback retrain.

2. In msm_dp_ctrl_on_link(), the retry loop checks
   msm_dp_aux_is_link_connected() (which reads REG_DP_DP_HPD_INT_STATUS)
   before reading DPCD link status.  When HPD is delivered out-of-band via
   a downstream bridge (next_bridge != NULL), msm_dp_bridge_hpd_enable()
   is never called, REG_DP_DP_HPD_CTRL remains disabled, and
   msm_dp_aux_is_link_connected() always returns 0.  A single transient
   training failure (e.g. immediately after a USB-C PD Power Role Swap)
   therefore aborts the retry loop on attempt 1 and returns -ECONNRESET,
   while drm_dp_dpcd_read_link_status() was previously called unchecked.
   Check the return value of drm_dp_dpcd_read_link_status() directly so
   genuine disconnects still abort immediately while connected OOB HPD
   sinks can complete the retry loop.

Co-Authored-By: Antigravity <noreply@google.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c    | 11 ++++++-----
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c |  5 +----
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c
index 8b16b7cda..a91c5d4e2 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c
@@ -2345,10 +2345,8 @@ int msm_dp_ctrl_on_link(struct msm_dp_ctrl *msm_dp_ctrl)
 			break;
 		} else if (training_step == DP_TRAINING_1) {
 			/* link train_1 failed */
-			if (!msm_dp_aux_is_link_connected(ctrl->aux))
+			if (drm_dp_dpcd_read_link_status(ctrl->aux, link_status) < 0)
 				break;
-
-			drm_dp_dpcd_read_link_status(ctrl->aux, link_status);
 
 			rc = msm_dp_ctrl_link_rate_down_shift(ctrl);
 			if (rc < 0) { /* already in RBR = 1.6G */
@@ -2370,10 +2368,8 @@ int msm_dp_ctrl_on_link(struct msm_dp_ctrl *msm_dp_ctrl)
 			}
 		} else if (training_step == DP_TRAINING_2) {
 			/* link train_2 failed */
-			if (!msm_dp_aux_is_link_connected(ctrl->aux))
+			if (drm_dp_dpcd_read_link_status(ctrl->aux, link_status) < 0)
 				break;
-
-			drm_dp_dpcd_read_link_status(ctrl->aux, link_status);
 
 			if (!drm_dp_clock_recovery_ok(link_status,
 					ctrl->link->link_params.num_lanes))
@@ -2552,8 +2548,11 @@ int msm_dp_ctrl_on_stream(struct msm_dp_ctrl *msm_dp_ctrl, bool force_link_train)
 		ctrl->stream_clks_on = true;
 	}
 
-	if (force_link_train || !msm_dp_ctrl_channel_eq_ok(ctrl))
+	if (force_link_train || !msm_dp_ctrl_channel_eq_ok(ctrl)) {
+		/* stop any active training pattern before restarting training */
+		msm_dp_ctrl_clear_training_pattern(ctrl, DP_PHY_DPRX);
 		msm_dp_ctrl_link_retrain(ctrl);
+	}
 
 	/* stop txing train pattern to end link training */
 	msm_dp_ctrl_clear_training_pattern(ctrl, DP_PHY_DPRX);
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c
index 908d60cd4..7e6a3d10c 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c
@@ -1419,10 +1419,8 @@ void msm_dp_bridge_atomic_enable(struct drm_bridge *drm_bridge,
 		return;
 	}
 
-	if (!dp->power_on) {
+	if (!dp->power_on)
 		msm_dp_display_host_phy_init(msm_dp_display);
-		force_link_train = true;
-	}
 
 	rc = msm_dp_ctrl_on_link(msm_dp_display->ctrl);
 	if (rc) {
-- 
2.53.0
